# UI Setup Checklist
RULE: Follow complete UI setup: React/Vue with TypeScript strict mode, ESLint zero warnings, smoke tests, Playwright E2E.
WHY: Ensures consistent UI quality; catches type errors early; validates critical user flows.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/ui-setup-checklist.md
DO: Enable TypeScript strict mode; configure ESLint with no warnings; create smoke tests for all pages
NEVER: Use `any` types; skip smoke tests; allow ESLint warnings; skip type checking in quality gates
